  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 12
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Guests arrive from the road at the top of the plot with seven needs: hunger,
    thirst, bladder, hygiene, fun, energy and tan. Build venues that satisfy them,
    set prices in the inspector, and their mood feeds your reputation - which brings
    more guests tomorrow.


    Litter piles up where guests wander; bins nearby
    reduce it. Hire cleaners to fight litter and dirty venues, and assign attendants
    to busy venues for extra capacity.


    Some guests book a hotel stay on arrival:
    at night they check in, pay the nightly rate and sleep until 07:30. Keep them
    fed and entertained for the days they stay.


    Watch the weather - rain kills
    tanning and arrivals, heatwaves sell drinks. Marketing campaigns boost tomorrow''s
    crowds for a daily fee. Lifeguard towers prevent beach accidents. Goals pay cash
    rewards.


    If the books stay in the red for the bank''s patience period,
    the resort goes bust.


    Controls: WASD or middle-drag to pan, Q/E to rotate,
    right-drag to look around, wheel to zoom, X for demolish mode, Esc to cancel,
    click a building to inspect and adjust it.'
